repeat family member 7) to this gene. [provided by RefSeq, Apr 2014].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"O95801","text":"Co-chaperone that recruits molecular chaperones Hsp90 (HSC82 and HSP82) and Hsp70 (SSA1) to nascent polypeptides, facilitating their proper folding into functional proteins (PubMed:18320024). Client proteins include eukaryotic elongation factor eEF2, a key player in cellular translation. Stimulates SSA1 ATPase activity, but not Hsp90 ATPase activity (By similarity). Promotes Sendai virus (SeV)-induced host cell innate immune responses (PubMed:29251827)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}